        "id": "p37-q11-a",
        "type": "part",
        "label": "a",
        "prompt": "How far west of $A$ is $B$, correct to 1 decimal place?",
        "layout": "list",
        "columns": null,
        "questionDiagrams": [],
        "children": [],
        "answer": {
          "short": "$11.3\\text{ km}$",
          "worked": "Let $x$ be the westward distance in kilometres. The angle between $AB$ and west is $270^\\circ-250^\\circ=20^\\circ$.\n$$\\begin{align*}\\cos20^\\circ&=\\frac{x}{12}\\\\x&=12\\cos20^\\circ\\\\x&\\approx11.3\\text{ km}\\end{align*}$$",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
        },
        "answerSpaceMm": 32
      },
      {
        "id": "p37-q11-b",
        "type": "part",
        "label": "b",
        "prompt": "Find the bearing of $A$ from $B$.",
        "layout": "list",
        "columns": null,
        "questionDiagrams": [],
        "children": [],
        "answer": {
          "short": "$070^\\circ\\text{ T}$",
          "worked": "The reverse bearing differs by $180^\\circ$.\n$$250^\\circ-180^\\circ=70^\\circ$$\nThe bearing of $A$ from $B$ is $070^\\circ\\text{ T}$.",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
        },
        "answerSpaceMm": 14
      }
    ]
